WEBVTT

00:26:27.579 --> 00:26:30.704
And when I do something wrong, as
you pointed out so many times,

00:26:31.246 --> 00:26:35.121
I have a choice about whether I'm going to
interpret what I'm feeling as shame.

00:26:35.121 --> 00:26:37.496
I'm a bad person or guilt.
I did a bad thing.

00:26:38.371 --> 00:26:40.246
That's right, you wanna
hear something crazy?

00:26:40.371 --> 00:26:43.371
Yes, yes, yeah, let me tell
you something crazy.

00:26:43.371 --> 00:26:46.454
So we have communities of facilitators

00:26:46.454 --> 00:26:51.038
and when we look at evaluation's from that
that kind of deeply therapeutic work

00:26:51.038 --> 00:26:55.996
where people will spend a facilitator will
spend 12 weeks taking people through,

00:26:56.288 --> 00:27:00.954
you know, daring, greatly rising,
strong curriculum in the end.